# Secrets — `.env` alone does NOT match `.env.<suffix>` variants.
# .env.s30 sat untracked here holding 8 live credentials (Tradovate
# password/secret, Databento key, Telegram token) — one `git add -A` from
# being pushed to a public remote.
.env.*
!.env.example
!*.env.template
